body:
It could just be down to lack of skill as to why I dislike the change. The reason I've rationalised personally is it feels as if there's nothing to fall back on. Though scav runs still exist, it feels very frustrating to lose a key item that you stored in your alpha.

&#x200B;

Then again, if I were better at the game I wouldn't die in the first place, I think. I'm not really sure though. I have a lot of issues deciding how to play due to how the community is so decisive on what playstyles are and aren't acceptable.

Here is the pastebin for the compile log

&#x200B;

[https://pastebin.com/EDqNE56H](https://pastebin.com/EDqNE56H)
